  "prefLabel": "Bea 306.01 Final Project Reporting",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Bea 306.01 Final Project Reporting. Project reporting shall be submitted 90 days following the completion of the project, organizations shall:\n\n(a) Complete and submit Form JPP-3, “Evaluation Report” 07/2026 edition;\n\n(b) Include the following with the form, if applicable:\n\n(1) A copy of the vendor’s distribution report; and\n\n(2) A copy of any quantitative research; and\n\n(c) Submit electronically the completed evaluation report and all attachments to: jppadministrator@livefree.nh.gov.\n\nSource. #13270, eff 9-30-21; ss by #14624, eff 7-7-26, EXPIRES: 7-7-36 (formerly Bea 306.02)",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/bea300.html"
